# Service-level Docker ignore — works for all three Dockerfiles.
# Keeps node_modules, .git, etc., out of the build context.
# Speeds up `docker build` and trims GHA cache size.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

*.log
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Don't ship the chart to the image build context
**/infrastructure
